@startuml Sequence_Admin_CitraFrame

title Sequence Diagram Admin - Sistem CitraFrame

autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  ActorBorderColor #C09553
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  ParticipantBorderColor #C09553
  BoxBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
}

actor "Admin CitraFrame" as Admin
boundary "Frontend Panel Admin\n(/login, /dashboard)" as FE
control "Backend Admin API\n(Controllers & Handlers)" as BE
entity "Database MySQL\n(CitraFrame)" as DB

== 1. Autentikasi & Login Admin ==
Admin -> FE: Buka Halaman Login (/login) & Input Username + Password
FE -> BE: POST /api/admin/login {username, password}
BE -> BE: Verifikasi Kredensial & Generate JWT Token
BE --> FE: Set HTTP-Only Cookie (jwt_token) & Return 200 OK
FE --> Admin: Redirect ke Dashboard Admin (/dashboard)

== 2. Monitoring Statistik Dashboard ==
FE -> BE: GET /api/admin/stats (terproteksi JwtMiddleware)
BE -> DB: SELECT count(orders), sum(total_amount), popular_products
DB --> BE: Hasil Rekapitulasi Statistik
BE --> FE: JSON Data Statistik Dashboard
FE --> Admin: Tampilkan Grafik & Ringkasan Metrik Dashboard

== 3. Manajemen Produk Bingkai & Art Prints (CRUD) ==
Admin -> FE: Pilih Menu Produk / Art Prints & Lakukan Tambah / Edit / Hapus
FE -> BE: POST / PUT / DELETE /api/products (atau /api/prints)
BE -> DB: INSERT / UPDATE / DELETE pada tabel products / art_prints
DB --> BE: Query Eksekusi Berhasil
BE --> FE: Status 200 OK & Data Baru
FE --> Admin: Tampilkan Notifikasi Sukses & Refresh Tabel

== 4. Manajemen Slider Beranda & Produk Populer ==
Admin -> FE: Tambah/Hapus Slider Promo atau Set Produk Populer
FE -> BE: POST /api/slides atau PUT /api/products/{id}/set-popular
BE -> DB: UPDATE tabel sliders / status populer produk
DB --> BE: Query Berhasil
BE --> FE: Status 200 OK
FE --> Admin: Tampilkan Perubahan pada Panel Admin

== 5. Manajemen Pesanan & Update Status Order ==
Admin -> FE: Buka Halaman Pesanan (/dashboard/order) & Filter/Cari Pesanan
FE -> BE: GET /api/admin/orders?status=...&search=...
BE -> DB: SELECT * FROM orders WHERE ... ORDER BY created_at DESC
DB --> BE: Daftar Pesanan Pelanggan
BE --> FE: JSON Daftar Pesanan
FE --> Admin: Tampilkan Tabel Daftar Pesanan

Admin -> FE: Lihat Detail Pesanan Tertentu
FE -> BE: GET /api/admin/orders/{id}
BE -> DB: SELECT order, order_items, shipping_address FROM orders
DB --> BE: Rincian Lengkap Pesanan
BE --> FE: JSON Detail Pesanan
FE --> Admin: Tampilkan Modal Detail Item, Alamat, & Bukti Bayar

Admin -> FE: Ubah Status Pesanan (misal: PROCESSING -> SHIPPED -> DELIVERED)
FE -> BE: PUT /api/admin/orders/{id}/status {status: "SHIPPED"}
BE -> DB: UPDATE orders SET order_status = ? WHERE id = ?
DB --> BE: Rows Affected
BE --> FE: JSON {message: "Status updated successfully"}
FE --> Admin: Status Pesanan Diperbarui pada Tabel

== 6. Logout Admin ==
Admin -> FE: Klik Tombol Logout
FE -> BE: POST /api/admin/logout
BE --> FE: Clear Cookie jwt_token (Clear-Site-Data)
FE --> Admin: Redirect ke Halaman Login (/login)

@enduml
